,"url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50266897/cj-carr-tommy-first-start-notre-dame-michigan","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 NFL draft QB rankings: Arch Manning, Dante Moore, Drew Mestemaker in top 15","description":"Who are the best quarterbacks in the 2027 draft class? We sized up the top 15, including Arch Manning, Dante Moore, Trinidad Chambliss and Darian Mensah.","published":"2026-10-09T12:14:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/50117790/2027-nfl-draft-quarterbacks-ranking-strengths-weaknesses","type":"Story","byline":"Jordan Reid","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079369/cj-carr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CJ_Carr"},"pick":{"pick":10,"round":1,"team":"ATL","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"CJ Carr","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CJ_Carr","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Curtis Jason Carr (born May 26, 2005) is an American college football quarterback for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Carr attended Saline High School in Saline, Michigan. He passed for 2,696 yards with 28 touchdowns as a sophomore, 2,685 yards with 26 touchdowns as a junior and 2,754 yards and 24 touchdowns as a senior. Carr played in the 2024 All-American Bowl. A four star recruit, he committed to the University of Notre Dame to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Carr enrolled at Notre Dame in 2023 and is a philosophy major in the College of Arts and Letters. In his first season in 2024, he was the fourth-string quarterback behind Riley Leonard. He played in just one game and took a redshirt. In 2025, with Leonard drafted into the NFL and backup Steve Angeli transferring, Carr competed for and won the starting quarterback job over Kenny Minchey."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Tommy Carr","description":"American football player (born 2007)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tommy_Carr_(American_football)"}]}}